<p>Hey, <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/alex-qijia-wang" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(6672851); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=6672851&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1597611096" alt="Alex Qijia Wang" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=6672851)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/alex-qijia-wang" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(6672851); return false;">Alex Qijia Wang</a></span>. Welcome to the SCP Wiki!</p>
<p>Glad to see you're interested in becoming a member of the site. I suggest you check out these resources to help you out in navigating the wiki:</p>
