<p>Hello FlukyLake!</p>
<p>A tad belated but welcome to the site! No worries if introductions aren't your thing, thanks for sharing with us regardless. As for tales or articles, I don't have anything on hand to recommend to you right now, but I'll leave you with my reader's resources so hopefully you can find something that suits your fancy! If you have any further questions, feel free to reach out.</p>
<p>Instruments are cool! I would love to see some more music based content here on the site, if contributing that way ever interests you.</p>
<div class="collapsible-block">
<div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">+Here&nbsp;are&nbsp;some&nbsp;places&nbsp;to&nbsp;start.</a></div>
